;; expect: main.same refused no_decision
;; roots: reg.shard main.shard
;; §8.4 slice 3.19 rule 6 (found by the second reader): an entry is visible where its
;; deriving module is. `reg` registers a decision for `other.T`; this file imports `other`
;; alone, so the entry is not its own — whichever of the two the loader was given first (it
;; had been visible here when `reg` was loaded before, and the module's hash with it)
(import "other.shard")
(import Init Int.decEq)
(fn same ((a other.T) (b other.T)) Nat (if (= a b) 1 0))
